>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `harvest_registrations`

``` hol4
Refute.harvest_registrations : unit ->
  {typedefs : hol_type list, quotients : hol_type list,
   theories_scanned : string list}
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Registers every harvestable typedef and quotient in scope.

The model finder normally harvests a typedef or quotient when a goal
first needs it.  This call does so at once for every type operator of
the current theory and its ancestors, and returns the types it newly
registered and the theories it scanned.  A type that cannot be
harvested is skipped.

### See also

[`Refute.register_typedef`](#Refute.register_typedef),
[`Refute.register_quotient`](#Refute.register_quotient)
